WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Release-Group "Mania" presents
doramamania

00:00:25.560 --> 01:13:29.300
Mania

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.710
Can a nomad be cured?

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.840
and make him human, even if he has gone wild?

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:08.180
We're not trying to make him human again.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.730
We're trying to keep him conscious so he can talk.

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:18.730
So you're not trying to save him

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.990
When a nomad turns into a souleater, there's no turning back

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:24.240
They are monsters

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:29.030
Or they will feed on human energy,

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.290
or they will petrify. One of two

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.300
We can't prevent this

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:45.720
Ice stone

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.260
I heard that he has Hwangsu's strength

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.350
Can a stone stop circulation?

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.980
Maybe. But...

00:01:57.190 --> 00:02:01.030
people should not use such power under any circumstances

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.370
Looks like it's going to rain

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:21.300
And I couldn't use the power of reflectors

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:24.340
It looks like everything will be washed away by the rain

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:27.380
Does the reflector's power disappear when it rains?

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:30.050
The power of the ice stone came from heaven

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:32.720
So heaven can take this power away

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.620
Did she try to call upon the power of heaven,

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:59.170
to hide the stone?

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo, Zero_Amamiya

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.460
Jin Bu Young

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:09.970
If she were alive, she would become a powerful priestess,

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:13.220
who can control the power of heaven

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:38.830
Are you okay

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.380
I'm fine too. You haven't gone wild

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.020
The gates above the bowl of constellations opened

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.980
- Wasn’t the ceiling always like this?
- No

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:08.030
Everyone thinks so

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:10.780
but they told me that this is not so

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:13.120
Who? Your father?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.750
He said to open the gate above the bowl

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.290
maybe only a magician-stargazer

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:22.670
How did this happen?

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:26.000
It seems we did something we shouldn't have

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.420
But how?

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:30.510
It's me

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:33.970
I opened the gate

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.850
My energy leaked into the water

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:39.430
Like at Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:41.890
and in the mirror of Tosca

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:46.020
My energy has returned thanks to this water

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.460
What does lightning strike mean?

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.590
A loud sound came from the recording room

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:12.420
There are eunuch Kim and Chan Wook there now

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:22.350
This is the power of the reflector

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:25.940
Same dark energy as when Kil Joo tried to swap bodies

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.610
What's happened?

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:33.280
I don't see anything, as in the case of a mirror

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.360
Dizzy and nauseous

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.530
Jin Mu will come soon, we have to leave

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:51.340
Exactly. door

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:56.390
He closed the door with energy, the bowl of constellations is broken,

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:57.890
and the soulswallower is dead

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:00.390
We have problems

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:03.640
There is an exit for servants next to the constellation bowl

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.850
My father led me out through this door

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.440
But we will still be in Jeonbugwan

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:16.610
You don't see, but I don't know the way

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:21.370
If we get lost, we will be caught

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:23.700
If we stay here, Jin Mu will come and kill us

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.540
I won't win against him

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:31.960
I need to call my savior

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.090
- The Savior?
- There is one

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:40.640
His heart will tremble and he will come right away

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:42.760
My savior

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:09.250
Chan Wook, are you kidding me?

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.550
Did you hear a loud sound?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:19.680
Yes, but you said not to come in, so we waited

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:22.470
Yeom Soo, follow me. The others are guarding the door

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.360
Chan Wook broke the barrier and escaped

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:41.280
Deputy

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.370
Bowl of constellations...

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:46.410
What happened to her?

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.000
We need to find him

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.960
We can't let him out of here alive

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.340
Take the body to the secret room

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:56.050
- No one should see you
- Yes

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.810
Close all exits

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:06.680
Find Chan Wook and his maid

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:09.770
If necessary, you can kill them

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:10.810
- Yes
- Yes

00:08:25.490 --> 00:08:29.160
Chan Wook will never get out of this maze

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:31.960
He'll get lost and get caught

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:35.290
Or maybe...

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:40.170
he knew he would get lost so he just hid inside

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:45.260
You almost got it

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:47.760
Are you here?

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:51.520
You broke the barrier that I made

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.650
Let's do another one. Fiery

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:58.070
If I set this place on fire,

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:00.900
it will probably be quite hot,

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:03.280
to make you show up

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:07.410
Try to convince me like before, without threats

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:11.620
Why if I have nothing to lose?

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:15.960
You are a criminal who entered here without permission and also broke the cup

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:18.090
And my job is to catch the criminal

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.130
I'm the deputy of Gwangju

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:26.260
You are too cruel to the guest who came with a gift

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:29.810
Upset that we turned your friend to stone?

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:30.970
What friend?

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:36.190
There was no one here except you two and me.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:39.070
Aaaaand... want to hide a stone body?

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:41.360
But what can we do?

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:45.360
- You will be caught
- This won't happen

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:48.740
Because you and your maid will die

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:50.910
Come out

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:52.620
Come out!

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:21.730
Have you seen it?

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:24.110
Lightning struck near Jeonbugwan

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.780
Jeonbugwan next to the palace

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:29.530
We need to check if everything is okay

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.450
Lightning struck so hard

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:33.950
I hope it's right according to Jin Moo

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:50.470
What a shame

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:54.100
Surely he came here happy,

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:56.390
imagining becoming gwangju

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.060
But instead you'll die

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.900
You're out of luck

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:02.400
This won't work

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:04.280
If I die

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:06.610
you can easily become gwangju

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:08.280
And this cannot be allowed

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:09.360
What?

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:13.620
Have you heard about yin-yang jade?

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:17.620
This is a pair of red and blue jade

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.290
If you pour energy into one stone, the second will feel it

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:21.710
If they're nearby

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.550
they will find each other

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:26.760
So what?

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:28.300
One of two stones, blue,

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:31.140
now with the Crown Prince

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:34.350
Cute jade

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:36.980
I got it in exchange for toads

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:38.230
Is he valuable?

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:42.020
So what?

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:44.320
I had red

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.940
I poured energy into him, which means His Highness

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.400
on the way here now

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.040
Will you kill me and take the stone?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:05.170
I thought so, so I hid the stone

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:10.130
Filled it with energy and hid it

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:12.180
in the robe of a eunuch soul swallower

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:25.650
His Highness is probably now in a hurry to the stone body

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.320
Imagine his reaction when he sees this

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.820
He will be more than surprised

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.300
Jeonbugwan

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:52.880
Chan Wook is somewhere in Jeonbugwan

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:02.020
Don't waste your time killing me

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.900
better stop the Crown Prince

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.110
I'll be back soon

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:14.700
You still won't be able to escape from here.

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:28.460
- Where is the body?
- In the secret room

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:31.090
If you order, I will take him out of there

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.060
Where...

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:48.610
He's not here. This bastard fooled me

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:53.030
Deputy

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.910
You ordered not to let anyone in, but there was no choice

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:59.160
What? Is the Crown Prince here?

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:00.200
Yes

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.500
So he didn't lie about jade

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:22.220
Deputy

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:25.390
The royal eunuch turned into a soul swallower?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:31.190
And you tried to secretly kill Chan Wook?

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:33.190
This is a misunderstanding, Your Highness

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:11.520
Have you tried

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.230
feed my maid to this soul swallower

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:18.240
Better give a normal explanation for what is happening

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:33.500
You are asking about Cho Chun, who worked

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:35.800
stargazer in Jeonbugwan?

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:40.050
I heard Chang Gang and Cho Chun were close

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:41.180
Yes

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:43.600
They were good friends

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:45.930
Cho Chun visited us often

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:50.060
He was a cheerful and kind person

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:52.860
Cho Chun used dark magic

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:55.570
what destroyed his whole family

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:57.240
He was a good man

00:15:57.940 --> 00:16:01.410
I still can't believe this happened

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:06.660
He had a daughter. Did you know her?

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.000
Yes, I remember her

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:13.250
She was always with her father, they were close

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.380
I heard she was missing

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.170
I think

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:19.470
she's dead

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:22.760
Why did you decide this?

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:26.760
Master Chang Gang searched for this girl for a very long time.

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:30.980
If she were alive, he would have found her by now.

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:33.020
Unless it was hidden

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:35.690
Lady Do Hwa Died

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:38.690
This happened to his best friend

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:41.990
Master Chan was not himself then

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:45.910
He blamed himself for both deaths

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.160
and suffered a lot

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.830
He left the house in search of a friend's daughter

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.130
I thought he'd come back when he found her

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:55.670
But...

00:16:56.420 --> 00:17:00.260
It's strange that he left home for 20 years to find a girl

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:03.720
I'm starting to suspect that he left

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.260
for another reason

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:09.470
If he had found that girl 20 years ago,

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:12.890
her life wouldn't be so hard

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:16.940
And Chang Gang wouldn't feel guilty

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:18.570
"Guilt"?

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:22.610
Are you implying that Master Chan behaved incorrectly towards his friend?

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.320
He punished him for dark magic

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.370
As a magician, he had to

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:31.540
It doesn't matter how close they were, there was no other way

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:35.880
You can't judge what's true and what's not based on what you've seen.

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:38.960
There's a story behind everything

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:42.260
Fate is woven from stories and relationships

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:44.220
That is, painful relationships

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:49.220
Are the Cho and Chan families over?

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:51.890
Or are you...

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:56.900
Are you saying that that girl is in this house now?

00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:00.190
Did Pine Forest find her?

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:04.070
That girl

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:07.530
died

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.080
I see

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:16.080
It's a pity

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:19.250
We need to hold her wake.

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:23.760
Maid Kim

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:26.430
You are very kind

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:28.470
This is not a gesture of kindness

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:31.720
I just don't want her spirit to come into this world.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.730
and tormented the young master

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:38.610
What if her spirit is haunting Chang Wook?

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:41.650
We need to get rid of it. This must be an evil spirit

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:43.570
I won't let her stalk him

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:46.950
Evil spirit?

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.540
Where is Moo Deok?

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:53.830
Moo Deok?

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:57.500
I sent her to Jeonbugwan on an errand

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.050
Are you okay? Can you see?

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:08.640
Yes I see

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:10.300
And you, master?

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:12.640
Are you injured anywhere?

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:13.850
I'm fine

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:16.310
What does it mean if two people keep a matching item?

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:18.600
That they are married or dating

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:25.190
The head of Sosnovy Bor arrived on your orders

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:47.510
You have arrived in Jeonbugwan

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:50.930
give the deputy honey cookies??

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:54.850
Yes. I heard you were fighting over them

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.770
Maid Kim didn't want him to be upset,

00:19:57.850 --> 00:19:59.850
that's why I came to deliver her package

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:01.350
Pathetic excuse

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:03.560
Head of Sosnovy Bor

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:06.650
and the deputy of Gwangju were fighting over cookies?

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:10.700
Even if this is true, it was worth keeping silent about it

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:12.990
What were you doing in the recording room?

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:15.410
I wanted to see the bowl of constellations

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:18.290
But in the end I saw something that I shouldn’t have

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:23.130
Are you sure you saw a soul swallower?

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:26.670
Yes. He put a barrier around me to hide it

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:29.300
and threw Moo Dok to him so that he could get enough

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:30.840
He's lying

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:35.510
Chan Wook entered the recording room without permission

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.520
and broke the cup of constellations

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:39.930
And when he was caught,

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:42.940
started making up all sorts of things about the soul swallower

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.520
I'm sure it was a soul swallower

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:48.570
He turned to stone

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:50.780
My maid saw it too

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:52.950
When I arrived I didn't see the body

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:54.620
He probably hid it

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:56.450
Seal all exits

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.370
and find the soulswallower before he takes him out

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:06.590
I think the truth will come out when we find the body.

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:12.430
I will call the magicians to inspect Jeonbugwan

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:15.930
This is not possible. I can't let them do this

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:18.350
because of someone's baseless lie

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:25.310
Chan Wook,

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:28.520
was the king's eunuch the soul swallower?

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:29.480
Yes

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:33.200
I saw him with the queen when we had a duel

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:35.820
EUNUCH Oh, who was there that day?

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:38.490
Eunuch Kim. He serves the queen

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:42.830
So, we need to check whether he is in the palace now or not.

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:45.040
Go check it out

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:47.170
There's no need for that

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:11.610
The Queen has arrived!

00:22:11.690 --> 00:22:13.280
Greet her

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:21.990
Mother

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:25.620
The deputy told me what happened

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:27.630
I was surprised, so I came in person

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:34.220
Did they really find a soul swallower here?

00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:37.260
The eunuch who served you was a nomad

00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:39.930
He went wild and petrified here

00:22:41.720 --> 00:22:44.020
- Is that so?
- This is not true

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:46.980
No one here has turned to stone

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:48.270
It's a lie

00:22:49.560 --> 00:22:51.230
which was invented by Chan Wook

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:55.950
We'll know if it's true or false when we find out where the eunuch is.

00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:02.620
Who is this eunuch who supposedly turned to stone?

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:05.000
Eunuch Kim

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:15.970
Eunuch Kim came here with me

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:28.520
Eunuch Kim, come in

00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:03.220
This eunuch

00:24:04.300 --> 00:24:06.220
did you see

00:24:06.810 --> 00:24:08.470
petrified?

00:24:10.230 --> 00:24:11.270
Yes

00:24:11.350 --> 00:24:13.980
You said he's gone wild

00:24:14.060 --> 00:24:16.400
But he stands here alive and well

00:24:17.820 --> 00:24:19.070
You're right

00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:24.620
He's fine

00:24:33.290 --> 00:24:35.460
The only way to resolve this is

00:24:38.460 --> 00:24:41.010
bring him back to life

00:24:57.150 --> 00:24:58.770
He's fine, completely fine

00:24:59.900 --> 00:25:01.940
If this is the power of the ice stone,

00:25:02.030 --> 00:25:04.490
this means I can save Moo Deok even if she goes wild

00:25:05.410 --> 00:25:06.410
Moo Deok,

00:25:07.700 --> 00:25:09.580
we must have made a mistake

00:25:11.410 --> 00:25:12.790
Probably the owner

00:25:15.040 --> 00:25:17.630
You're right. You lied

00:25:17.710 --> 00:25:19.800
He's standing here alive

00:25:20.670 --> 00:25:22.840
it turns out I really was lying

00:25:27.300 --> 00:25:29.260
He tried to fool everyone

00:25:29.350 --> 00:25:32.560
because he broke the cup of constellations

00:25:32.640 --> 00:25:33.850
Chan Wook,

00:25:35.230 --> 00:25:36.980
is this true?

00:25:38.610 --> 00:25:42.230
Yes. Everything I said is a lie

00:25:45.070 --> 00:25:48.280
Snuck into Jeonbugwan, smashed the relic,

00:25:48.370 --> 00:25:52.200
and then lied to cover it up?

00:25:52.290 --> 00:25:55.000
I'm sorry, I'm sorry

00:25:57.710 --> 00:25:59.460
He is the magician of Sosnovy Bor,

00:25:59.540 --> 00:26:02.380
I personally apologize for it

00:26:04.090 --> 00:26:07.010
I also apologize to Deputy Jin Moo

00:26:11.180 --> 00:26:15.810
Pine forest will fix the bowl

00:26:18.190 --> 00:26:19.400
No need

00:26:19.480 --> 00:26:20.690
Don't give up

00:26:20.770 --> 00:26:23.230
This is the only way we can be held accountable for this.

00:26:24.940 --> 00:26:26.400
- It's not worth it
- Your Highness

00:26:26.990 --> 00:26:29.660
Let Sosnovy Bor correct the mistake.

00:26:31.950 --> 00:26:33.490
Let them, mother

00:26:35.540 --> 00:26:37.410
Do as you please

00:26:38.540 --> 00:26:40.630
It's time for me to go back

00:27:03.440 --> 00:27:06.400
I'll send my people tomorrow

00:27:06.490 --> 00:27:08.360
to fix a broken bowl

00:27:09.110 --> 00:27:12.410
And now I must return to properly punish the magician,

00:27:12.490 --> 00:27:15.700
who lied to the prince and the people of Jeonbugwan

00:27:16.750 --> 00:27:18.210
- Forward
- It won’t work that way

00:27:18.910 --> 00:27:22.210
Chan Wook will stay here and suffer his punishment

00:27:27.460 --> 00:27:29.260
I think so too...

00:27:30.260 --> 00:27:32.090
What's going on, Your Highness?

00:27:32.890 --> 00:27:34.600
Save my master

00:27:35.220 --> 00:27:37.390
If he is taken to Sosnovy Bor,

00:27:40.060 --> 00:27:43.810
he will be beaten to death there

00:27:46.190 --> 00:27:47.690
Last time

00:27:47.780 --> 00:27:49.900
he received a hundred blows

00:27:50.610 --> 00:27:52.700
This time it will be worse

00:27:52.780 --> 00:27:54.910
Don't let this happen

00:27:56.910 --> 00:27:58.120
Moo Deok, that's enough.

00:28:00.120 --> 00:28:03.250
I did wrong and I will be punished

00:28:06.880 --> 00:28:09.050
I did not show due respect to His Highness

00:28:11.630 --> 00:28:13.430
I don't dare ask for mercy

00:28:13.510 --> 00:28:17.350
Then let them take you and kill you?

00:28:18.060 --> 00:28:20.270
If the head wants it, then yes

00:28:23.150 --> 00:28:23.980
Heaven...

00:28:29.940 --> 00:28:31.400
You can pick me up

00:28:33.820 --> 00:28:35.570
How so, master!

00:28:35.660 --> 00:28:37.280
You will die!

00:28:37.910 --> 00:28:41.960
You will die if you return to Sosnovy Bor!

00:28:44.580 --> 00:28:49.050
I will punish him as required by the rule book.

00:28:53.260 --> 00:28:54.930
Hey you. Wait

00:28:59.470 --> 00:29:01.520
Chan Wook will be punished

00:29:01.600 --> 00:29:03.230
forget about what happened

00:29:04.270 --> 00:29:05.810
This is just funny

00:29:05.900 --> 00:29:06.940
But

00:29:07.480 --> 00:29:09.980
the cookie story is even worse

00:29:10.690 --> 00:29:13.320
Head of Pine Forest and Deputy of Gwangju

00:29:13.400 --> 00:29:15.030
fighting over cookies?

00:29:15.990 --> 00:29:16.990
Just laughter

00:29:17.740 --> 00:29:19.160
The stupidest excuse

00:29:20.990 --> 00:29:21.830
You're right

00:29:24.250 --> 00:29:26.170
But how did the bowl of constellations break?

00:29:29.130 --> 00:29:31.090
If lightning strikes,

00:29:31.170 --> 00:29:33.630
it means the gate above the bowl has opened

00:29:33.720 --> 00:29:36.930
But only those who have mastered Chisa can do this.

00:29:37.930 --> 00:29:39.140
It's true

00:29:42.270 --> 00:29:44.690
Chan Wook doesn't own Chisu

00:29:48.980 --> 00:29:51.020
How did the cup break?

00:29:56.990 --> 00:30:00.950
Was there anyone else here who owned Chisu?

00:30:01.700 --> 00:30:03.370
It's impossible

00:30:19.890 --> 00:30:23.140
We got out of there thanks to you, Moo Deok

00:30:23.220 --> 00:30:25.020
If you try to leave, they will stop you

00:30:25.100 --> 00:30:27.270
If you decide to stay, they’ll try to drive you away.

00:30:27.350 --> 00:30:31.150
So you staged this performance on purpose? Smart

00:30:31.230 --> 00:30:34.150
I decided that you won't convince them,

00:30:34.230 --> 00:30:36.450
so I intervened without permission

00:30:36.530 --> 00:30:38.570
Sorry for intruding

00:30:39.410 --> 00:30:42.490
I didn't expect this, so I was surprised

00:30:44.490 --> 00:30:45.660
But you're great

00:30:47.330 --> 00:30:48.540
Chapter

00:30:48.620 --> 00:30:50.580
We didn't lie

00:30:50.670 --> 00:30:54.340
We saw how eunuch Kim became wild and petrified

00:30:54.420 --> 00:30:55.710
I know they didn't lie

00:30:56.340 --> 00:30:58.720
Sometimes I'm not thinking clearly

00:30:58.800 --> 00:31:00.680
but I can tell lies from truth

00:31:01.640 --> 00:31:03.390
He was petrified, but came to his senses

00:31:03.470 --> 00:31:07.100
So they have an ice stone?

00:31:07.890 --> 00:31:09.560
Sosnovy Bor for a long time

00:31:10.520 --> 00:31:13.270
watching Jin Moo

00:31:13.940 --> 00:31:15.440
Everything is as we expected

00:31:17.740 --> 00:31:19.700
I guess they have the stone

00:31:25.700 --> 00:31:29.580
Did you use the stone to revive me?

00:31:29.660 --> 00:31:32.000
His strength is simply amazing

00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:35.420
I really feel alive

00:31:36.760 --> 00:31:40.130
Did Chang Wook turn you to stone?

00:31:41.050 --> 00:31:44.100
The energy suddenly started leaving my body

00:31:44.760 --> 00:31:48.680
when I was about to get enough of his maid

00:31:49.600 --> 00:31:50.980
Then I lost consciousness

00:31:52.150 --> 00:31:55.650
Didn't you see how Chang Wook opened the roof over the bowl of constellations?

00:31:56.360 --> 00:31:57.570
No, I haven't seen it

00:31:58.820 --> 00:32:01.360
Maybe there was another magician there besides Chan Wook?

00:32:02.320 --> 00:32:03.570
There was no

00:32:04.740 --> 00:32:06.910
What if Chan Wook has already possessed Chisu?

00:32:07.660 --> 00:32:08.950
Maybe he's just hiding it

00:32:10.660 --> 00:32:14.290
When he attacked me, he didn't look particularly skilled.

00:32:14.380 --> 00:32:17.500
He mastered Ryusu in an incredibly short time

00:32:18.340 --> 00:32:19.670
Therefore it is possible

00:32:22.630 --> 00:32:24.680
Now I have an ice stone inside me,

00:32:24.760 --> 00:32:27.970
does this mean I own Hwangsu?

00:32:31.230 --> 00:32:33.400
You really have that much power

00:32:34.440 --> 00:32:37.320
But you can't cast spells

00:32:37.400 --> 00:32:40.280
so you can't use this power

00:32:45.950 --> 00:32:48.790
But the ice stone is mine now

00:32:48.870 --> 00:32:51.830
I brought you back to life temporarily because we had no other choice.

00:33:45.760 --> 00:33:47.760
So it's a stone

00:33:47.840 --> 00:33:50.350
able to prevent the transformation of a nomad

00:33:51.310 --> 00:33:52.850
We must find him and destroy him

00:33:53.640 --> 00:33:57.270
We must destroy all the nomads, and he brings them back to life

00:33:57.350 --> 00:33:59.190
His strength is truly terrifying.

00:34:00.860 --> 00:34:01.900
But this...

00:34:03.740 --> 00:34:07.240
Uk, they will soon find out about your punishment,

00:34:07.320 --> 00:34:09.160
so you can't go back

00:34:09.870 --> 00:34:11.240
Stay home for a while

00:34:11.330 --> 00:34:15.160
Okay, Moo Deok and I will go home

00:34:15.250 --> 00:34:19.580
Try not to get noticed by Jin Moo

00:34:20.840 --> 00:34:21.840
Yes

00:34:23.880 --> 00:34:25.010
Let's go

00:34:33.270 --> 00:34:35.390
He will get rid of the stone as soon as he receives it

00:34:35.480 --> 00:34:37.390
We need to find him sooner

00:34:37.480 --> 00:34:39.060
Kil Joo was right

00:34:39.770 --> 00:34:42.480
Stone in the palace

00:34:43.020 --> 00:34:46.190
So Dan Zhu, who owns the stone...

00:34:47.150 --> 00:34:48.450
this is that person

00:34:52.740 --> 00:34:55.120
Deal with everything quietly

00:34:55.200 --> 00:34:57.790
I will send the court lady Han instead

00:34:57.870 --> 00:35:00.080
Will you send messages through it?

00:35:00.750 --> 00:35:01.920
I understand you

00:35:02.630 --> 00:35:06.800
Because of what happened, Sosnovy Bor will now suspect me

00:35:07.380 --> 00:35:12.010
This happened because you underestimated Chan Wook

00:35:12.600 --> 00:35:15.430
I didn't think he would free himself so quickly

00:35:15.520 --> 00:35:17.770
He is a genius who instantly mastered Ryusu

00:35:17.850 --> 00:35:20.020
He was born with the energy of the King's star

00:35:20.100 --> 00:35:21.730
I didn't immediately begin to underestimate him

00:35:22.690 --> 00:35:24.320
I thought he was special

00:35:24.400 --> 00:35:27.190
since he was born under the sign of such a star

00:35:27.280 --> 00:35:30.530
However, Chan Wook turned out to be a complete disappointment

00:35:30.610 --> 00:35:33.330
He was a simple boy, nothing special

00:35:36.410 --> 00:35:40.080
Angry at the world, he hid his helplessness and laziness

00:35:40.170 --> 00:35:44.290
under the mask of composure. He never had a goal

00:35:44.880 --> 00:35:47.340
He was just a noble young man with high self-esteem,

00:35:47.920 --> 00:35:50.260
so it was enough to serve him

00:35:51.220 --> 00:35:53.140
So he has changed

00:35:54.220 --> 00:35:55.850
I thought he was weak

00:35:55.930 --> 00:35:58.730
But he opened the gates of energy by drinking poison

00:35:58.810 --> 00:36:02.150
Thought he was just a braggart, but he really beat the Crown Prince

00:36:03.190 --> 00:36:05.270
What made him change so much?

00:36:05.360 --> 00:36:07.190
People change

00:36:08.690 --> 00:36:10.150
for the sake of other people

00:36:11.450 --> 00:36:14.200
Find the one who appeared in his life shortly before all the changes

00:36:17.240 --> 00:36:18.410
This will be the answer

00:36:22.290 --> 00:36:25.840
Chan Wook was rejected by twelve teachers, but he still found his way

00:36:29.460 --> 00:36:31.130
Who could help him with this?

00:36:34.890 --> 00:36:37.470
Teacher, can we go to Danhyangok right away?

00:36:38.810 --> 00:36:41.430
Thanks to my punishment we have time

00:36:42.020 --> 00:36:43.770
Let's practice in Danhyangok

00:36:43.850 --> 00:36:46.650
We can try to climb that tree

00:36:50.780 --> 00:36:52.740
It's very cold in Danhyangok right now

00:36:53.660 --> 00:36:56.120
If we get stuck there because of the snow,

00:36:57.120 --> 00:36:58.580
we may die of hunger

00:36:58.660 --> 00:37:01.660
I thought it was warm in winter and there was plenty of food

00:37:01.750 --> 00:37:04.080
You told Yulia that last time

00:37:08.000 --> 00:37:11.340
I said that to calm him down

00:37:15.840 --> 00:37:19.220
He was worried that his tame bird had a hard time in the winter,

00:37:19.310 --> 00:37:20.720
that's why I lied

00:37:21.560 --> 00:37:25.940
Are you talking about the bird he called with his whistle when he was in Danhyangok?

00:37:47.790 --> 00:37:50.960
Did Jin Moo almost kill Wook?

00:37:52.380 --> 00:37:56.380
I apologized for Uka and took him away from there

00:37:56.470 --> 00:37:59.220
But Jin Moo might try to harm him

00:38:02.350 --> 00:38:05.600
Fortunately, I insisted that we fix the constellation bowl,

00:38:05.690 --> 00:38:07.400
so we will have access to Jeonbugwan

00:38:09.810 --> 00:38:13.030
You will go to Jeonbugwan with the workers of Sosnovy Bor

00:38:13.740 --> 00:38:15.360
and you will look after Jin Mu

00:38:16.740 --> 00:38:18.070
- Yes
- Yes

00:38:27.420 --> 00:38:28.670
San Ho

00:38:29.580 --> 00:38:32.340
I heard Moo Deok was in Jeonbugwan too

00:38:32.420 --> 00:38:34.090
Is she okay?

00:38:34.170 --> 00:38:35.470
Yes

00:38:38.970 --> 00:38:42.640
The nomad who went wild and turned to stone

00:38:42.720 --> 00:38:44.560
really came back to life?

00:38:44.640 --> 00:38:48.100
Therefore, the head had to return without saying anything

00:38:50.610 --> 00:38:52.400
How did Uk react to this?

00:38:52.980 --> 00:38:54.860
He didn't seem surprised

00:38:55.400 --> 00:38:58.200
He asked the head if the ice stone could

00:38:58.280 --> 00:39:00.910
bring the soul swallower back to life

00:39:00.990 --> 00:39:03.030
It seems he already knew about it

00:39:05.540 --> 00:39:08.540
This means that he personally saw how the nomad came to life

00:39:08.620 --> 00:39:11.080
The head told him that they need to be destroyed

00:39:12.250 --> 00:39:14.250
And nomads and stone

00:39:14.340 --> 00:39:16.510
Get rid of everything that is evil

00:39:19.430 --> 00:39:21.800
And what did Uk answer to this?

00:39:21.890 --> 00:39:23.810
This is just my guess

00:39:24.760 --> 00:39:26.310
but he doesn't seem to agree with it

00:39:27.140 --> 00:39:30.400
Chan Wook is always carefree and carefree

00:39:30.480 --> 00:39:34.440
But this is not the way to treat dark magic.

00:39:35.530 --> 00:39:37.490
You and Uk are close

00:39:37.570 --> 00:39:39.570
You should warn him

00:39:51.750 --> 00:39:54.250
Danhyangok is not only cold,

00:39:54.340 --> 00:39:56.670
there's no one there at all

00:39:57.550 --> 00:39:59.880
We can't be alone now

00:40:00.720 --> 00:40:02.220
Why is this suddenly?

00:40:04.970 --> 00:40:06.140
I'm afraid

00:40:08.770 --> 00:40:10.310
that I will absorb your energy

00:40:10.890 --> 00:40:14.150
You haven't gone wild. Nothing happened, even after our contact

00:40:14.230 --> 00:40:16.570
Because I absorbed that eunuch's energy

00:40:17.150 --> 00:40:18.570
Everything's fine now

00:40:18.650 --> 00:40:21.110
but we don't know when it might happen again

00:40:22.950 --> 00:40:24.410
If necessary,

00:40:25.200 --> 00:40:26.950
you can run away or kill me

00:40:29.410 --> 00:40:31.330
But if I absorb your energy

00:40:33.540 --> 00:40:35.040
I can't stand this

00:40:44.090 --> 00:40:45.300
What's so funny?

00:40:45.970 --> 00:40:47.470
Are you having fun?

00:40:48.260 --> 00:40:49.600
No, that's not the point

00:40:52.560 --> 00:40:53.730
My heart fluttered

00:40:56.360 --> 00:40:57.900
These are your words

00:40:59.190 --> 00:41:01.570
carry more meaning than "I missed you"

00:41:04.610 --> 00:41:06.990
The Shadow Warrior finally answered

00:41:08.330 --> 00:41:10.950
to my naive and sincere declaration of love

00:41:20.170 --> 00:41:22.050
I'll find a stone

00:41:22.760 --> 00:41:26.010
so you never have to absorb my energy

00:41:33.060 --> 00:41:35.190
You'll have to go against Park Jin

00:41:35.270 --> 00:41:38.110
Then I'll be just as strong

00:41:42.490 --> 00:41:45.490
You lost nine battles in a row to the magicians of Jeongjingak.

00:41:46.780 --> 00:41:48.120
Arrogant

00:41:51.410 --> 00:41:54.960
Exactly, yin-yang jade. I have to return it

00:41:56.120 --> 00:41:59.710
But how did you call the Crown Prince?

00:42:01.590 --> 00:42:03.800
There is one way...

00:42:04.880 --> 00:42:06.590
It makes my heart beat wildly

00:42:26.740 --> 00:42:29.410
Chan Wook, the alleged offender, did not have a sword

00:42:30.870 --> 00:42:33.830
But Jin Moo had it, although he insisted on his innocence

00:42:46.670 --> 00:42:48.130
Mister

00:42:48.220 --> 00:42:51.100
Master Li, what brings you here?

00:42:51.180 --> 00:42:53.220
Why are you not in Sosnovy Bor, but at home?

00:42:54.470 --> 00:42:56.060
He is punished

00:42:58.480 --> 00:43:00.190
Punished? For what?

00:43:00.940 --> 00:43:02.770
What have you done this time?

00:43:02.860 --> 00:43:04.230
No, it's not like that

00:43:04.320 --> 00:43:07.150
Maid Kim, don't worry so much

00:43:07.240 --> 00:43:08.570
It's like...

00:43:09.990 --> 00:43:11.990
fake punishment

00:43:12.080 --> 00:43:15.200
It's more of a vacation disguised as a punishment.

00:43:18.500 --> 00:43:19.830
It's true

00:43:21.330 --> 00:43:22.380
Glad to hear

00:43:23.630 --> 00:43:26.800
Then we'll go fishing on Lake Gyeongjeongdaeho

00:43:28.260 --> 00:43:29.510
Great idea

00:43:29.590 --> 00:43:33.930
You should relax here after spending time with Mr. Chan

00:43:35.060 --> 00:43:38.640
You can't, maid Kim. I can't slack off now

00:43:38.730 --> 00:43:40.100
Master Li, I'm sorry.

00:43:40.190 --> 00:43:42.730
I've already lost nine out of ten battles

00:43:42.810 --> 00:43:44.610
There's one last chance to win

00:43:45.270 --> 00:43:48.030
I'm going to train. I hope for your understanding

00:43:49.360 --> 00:43:52.410
You suddenly became so diligent

00:43:52.490 --> 00:43:55.660
Yes, my goal is to make Maid Kim proud of me.

00:43:55.740 --> 00:43:57.700
I can't sit back and fish

00:43:58.960 --> 00:44:02.830
Lately your words touch my soul

00:44:03.630 --> 00:44:04.590
Okay

00:44:04.670 --> 00:44:06.130
Go ahead and train

00:44:06.210 --> 00:44:09.050
And I will cook you sweets

00:44:17.810 --> 00:44:20.980
Tell the truth, why were you punished?

00:44:25.020 --> 00:44:27.280
I broke the cup of constellations in Jeonbugwan

00:44:28.360 --> 00:44:30.190
Don't tell that to maid Kim

00:44:30.280 --> 00:44:33.240
I saw lightning strike right over Jeonbugwan

00:44:33.320 --> 00:44:34.780
I guess she hit the cup

00:44:35.660 --> 00:44:39.370
We can't tell you the details, but the owner is not to blame for anything

00:44:40.870 --> 00:44:43.330
The head of Sosnovy Bor will tell you the rest

00:44:45.080 --> 00:44:46.540
I'll lend you my fishing rods

00:44:46.630 --> 00:44:48.460
I used to love fishing

00:44:48.550 --> 00:44:51.130
I have a couple of very good ones.

00:44:51.220 --> 00:44:52.090
I'll bring it now

00:44:57.430 --> 00:44:58.640
It's a pity

00:45:00.350 --> 00:45:04.100
I wanted to teach him how to catch goldfish

00:45:05.060 --> 00:45:06.110
Goldfish?

00:45:06.690 --> 00:45:10.190
You're talking about the one that can only be caught

00:45:10.280 --> 00:45:11.860
in Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake?

00:45:12.570 --> 00:45:13.820
Do you know what this is?

00:45:13.910 --> 00:45:17.120
I've heard about her. Fish that is formed from the energy of the lake

00:45:17.200 --> 00:45:21.410
I heard that only magicians who have mastered Chisu or higher can catch her

00:45:21.500 --> 00:45:23.660
You really know a lot

00:45:24.250 --> 00:45:26.290
When you caught that fish and you're in control

00:45:26.380 --> 00:45:28.000
energy of Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake...

00:45:29.550 --> 00:45:30.760
Pleasant feeling

00:45:32.130 --> 00:45:35.760
Share this with the owner

00:45:35.840 --> 00:45:36.840
He's busy

00:45:37.600 --> 00:45:39.220
Master Li

00:45:39.310 --> 00:45:41.180
Master Li, take a look

00:45:41.270 --> 00:45:43.350
This is the best fishing rod, it's made of bamboo...

00:45:43.430 --> 00:45:45.980
He's not busy, starting tomorrow

00:45:46.060 --> 00:45:48.940
he will go fishing with you

00:45:50.480 --> 00:45:52.490
What are you talking about? I need to train

00:45:52.570 --> 00:45:55.860
Now you should not hold a sword, but a fishing rod

00:45:57.160 --> 00:46:00.240
Go to Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake and catch a Golden Fish

00:46:00.910 --> 00:46:02.080
What?

00:46:14.630 --> 00:46:16.090
Seems like a good place

00:46:16.720 --> 00:46:18.140
No no, Master Li

00:46:18.840 --> 00:46:22.520
I've fished here before. The water is very cold

00:46:22.600 --> 00:46:25.350
There are no fish here because they have nothing to eat.

00:46:25.890 --> 00:46:28.900
And we took bad fishing rods

00:46:28.980 --> 00:46:32.400
Goldfish must be caught with a fishing rod that bends easily

00:46:33.400 --> 00:46:34.990
Just like this one

00:46:36.650 --> 00:46:38.860
Is this fish bait?

00:46:39.450 --> 00:46:40.620
These are sweets

00:46:40.700 --> 00:46:44.120
Maid Kim collected them for Master Lee

00:46:44.830 --> 00:46:47.750
Maid Kim is a very kind woman

00:46:48.330 --> 00:46:50.250
Where's the bait?

00:46:50.330 --> 00:46:52.420
We need worms or small fish

00:46:52.500 --> 00:46:53.920
What?

00:46:55.630 --> 00:46:57.680
Do you fish without bait?

00:46:57.760 --> 00:47:01.050
I told you that Goldfish feed on energy.

00:47:01.800 --> 00:47:04.470
My energy will go along the bamboo stick

00:47:05.100 --> 00:47:07.020
and will serve as bait

00:47:08.600 --> 00:47:09.600
Your energy?

00:47:10.690 --> 00:47:13.770
Master, repeat after the master

00:47:14.360 --> 00:47:15.360
Now

00:47:22.320 --> 00:47:26.370
Now you just need to control the energy of the lake

00:47:26.450 --> 00:47:28.660
and wait for the golden fish to bite

00:47:36.170 --> 00:47:37.260
Moo Deok

00:47:37.840 --> 00:47:40.930
I feel like a fool. Do I have to continue?

00:47:48.560 --> 00:47:49.520
I took the bait!

00:48:00.650 --> 00:48:02.360
This is the Golden Fish

00:48:03.030 --> 00:48:06.660
This is a clot of water that is formed from the energy of the lake

00:48:07.330 --> 00:48:10.580
Only those who have mastered Chisu or higher, capable of controlling water,

00:48:10.660 --> 00:48:12.330
they can catch her

00:48:15.040 --> 00:48:16.460
I haven't fished for a long time

00:48:16.550 --> 00:48:19.840
But I have to admit, it's still exciting to catch a Goldfish

00:48:22.130 --> 00:48:24.680
So it's not a real fish?

00:48:25.260 --> 00:48:27.560
Master Li didn't bring you here to fish.

00:48:28.270 --> 00:48:31.310
He is here to help you master Chisu

00:48:32.230 --> 00:48:33.560
Only those who have the strength

00:48:33.650 --> 00:48:36.520
can catch a clot of energy from Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho

00:48:37.610 --> 00:48:39.360
and master Chisu

00:48:41.150 --> 00:48:42.450
Chisu?

00:48:50.910 --> 00:48:53.210
Slowly

00:48:53.290 --> 00:48:54.170
Slowly

00:48:54.250 --> 00:48:57.250
No, you're in too much of a hurry. Slowly

00:48:57.960 --> 00:48:59.460
- Slowly
- No

00:49:12.520 --> 00:49:14.730
Jeonbugwan must have found another blind girl

00:49:14.810 --> 00:49:17.230
Cho Young says they bring blind girls

00:49:17.310 --> 00:49:19.190
from all over the country every day

00:49:21.780 --> 00:49:23.650
- Let's go in
- Yes

00:49:36.080 --> 00:49:38.130
So you are saying

00:49:38.210 --> 00:49:41.090
that perhaps there are nomads in every family,

00:49:41.170 --> 00:49:43.220
who participated in the murder of Nak Soo's father,

00:49:43.300 --> 00:49:45.300
and we need to use Jinyeowon's relics,

00:49:46.340 --> 00:49:47.510
to find them?

00:49:47.600 --> 00:49:49.810
We were going to wait until the nomad

00:49:49.890 --> 00:49:52.310
from Degantongun will come to consciousness,

00:49:52.390 --> 00:49:54.190
but we can't wait any longer

00:49:54.270 --> 00:49:55.690
The point is that

00:49:56.600 --> 00:49:58.770
last night we found another one

00:50:00.020 --> 00:50:01.360
I heard

00:50:01.440 --> 00:50:05.030
A nomad who was a eunuch was found in Jeonbugwan

00:50:05.110 --> 00:50:08.410
Jin Moo must have already visited you.

00:50:09.370 --> 00:50:13.870
My brother Jin Mu said that Pine Forest sent a burglar to Jeonbugwan,

00:50:14.500 --> 00:50:17.750
who tried to set him up. He was very upset

00:50:17.830 --> 00:50:20.960
To find out whether Jin Mu is guilty or not,

00:50:21.670 --> 00:50:25.670
we need the relics and powers of the head of Jinyeowon

00:50:25.760 --> 00:50:27.090
Help us

00:50:28.890 --> 00:50:29.930
Sorry,

00:50:31.430 --> 00:50:32.810
but I refuse

00:50:34.810 --> 00:50:38.560
There is nothing more shameful for a magician than being accused of using dark magic.

00:50:39.400 --> 00:50:40.860
If we will

00:50:40.940 --> 00:50:45.190
test magicians with their relics without any evidence,

00:50:46.150 --> 00:50:48.910
we'll only make people hate Jinyeowon

00:50:48.990 --> 00:50:50.320
I heard Jin Moo

00:50:51.200 --> 00:50:53.910
looking for your eldest daughter

00:50:54.830 --> 00:50:58.170
He asked you not to help Sosnovy Bor

00:50:58.670 --> 00:51:00.920
in exchange for help finding your daughter?

00:51:01.500 --> 00:51:03.380
- This has nothing to do with...
- No, it has

00:51:03.460 --> 00:51:07.970
Your behavior towards Sosnovy Bor has suddenly changed

00:51:08.050 --> 00:51:11.510
Do you want me to always do what you ask?

00:51:11.600 --> 00:51:12.970
Is this the kind of behavior you expect?

00:51:14.390 --> 00:51:18.310
Jinyoungwon disobeys

00:51:18.390 --> 00:51:19.900
Pine forest

00:51:19.980 --> 00:51:21.810
- Head Jin!
- Go away

00:51:22.400 --> 00:51:25.480
I have an appointment

00:51:36.290 --> 00:51:39.250
When they find your big sister

00:51:39.330 --> 00:51:42.750
there will be no more barriers to our love

00:51:42.840 --> 00:51:46.170
Because Sosnovy Bor and Jinyeowon have good relations

00:51:46.760 --> 00:51:48.010
Oh, that's right...

00:51:50.590 --> 00:51:51.720
Here

00:51:53.220 --> 00:51:55.810
This is the decoration I liked last time

00:51:56.470 --> 00:51:58.770
Someone already bought it

00:51:58.850 --> 00:52:00.440
How did you get it?

00:52:00.520 --> 00:52:03.610
Paid that man four times the amount

00:52:03.690 --> 00:52:05.400
Thought you'd like it

00:52:05.480 --> 00:52:07.570
I really like it

00:52:08.490 --> 00:52:11.240
Your happy smile

00:52:11.320 --> 00:52:15.030
makes me the happiest in the world

00:52:26.130 --> 00:52:28.050
Why does uncle look so upset?

00:52:28.130 --> 00:52:29.470
Did something happen?

00:52:30.510 --> 00:52:33.140
I think he had a big fight with the head of Jinyeowon.

00:52:52.950 --> 00:52:55.320
I drew a dark red mole behind her ear.

00:52:56.990 --> 00:53:01.080
As a child, Boo Young fell. She has a scar on her left arm

00:53:03.580 --> 00:53:06.040
About a third of a finger long

00:53:38.410 --> 00:53:41.580
This is necessary for you to become Jin Bu Young, be patient.

00:53:42.660 --> 00:53:44.500
Every scar, every mole...

00:53:44.580 --> 00:53:47.750
Any little thing her mother can remember

00:53:49.670 --> 00:53:50.750
Okay

00:53:50.840 --> 00:53:54.380
I'll pour acid on your skin to make the scar more visible.

00:54:38.090 --> 00:54:41.510
What kind of fish is Young Master Chan trying to catch?

00:54:41.600 --> 00:54:43.350
All he does is go to the lake

00:54:43.930 --> 00:54:46.480
I need to take them food

00:54:46.560 --> 00:54:48.560
I will ask servant Li to carry

00:54:48.650 --> 00:54:50.770
And you stay and help me

00:54:52.610 --> 00:54:56.530
We need to clean the house and prepare food for the memorial service.

00:54:58.030 --> 00:54:59.280
For whose?

00:54:59.360 --> 00:55:01.580
A young girl who died a terrible death

00:55:02.080 --> 00:55:04.330
She was mad at our family

00:55:04.410 --> 00:55:06.410
that's why I want to hold a wake for her

00:55:07.960 --> 00:55:09.290
Maid Kim

00:55:09.370 --> 00:55:10.880
I returned from the temple

00:55:10.960 --> 00:55:12.130
- Okay
- Here

00:55:12.210 --> 00:55:14.550
Buddhist monk wrote a speech

00:55:15.880 --> 00:55:17.590
What a wonderful speech

00:55:18.680 --> 00:55:20.300
But where are their names?

00:55:20.390 --> 00:55:22.550
I should have written down the names of the spirits

00:55:22.640 --> 00:55:23.930
Here they are

00:55:24.010 --> 00:55:26.810
Right here. Cho Chun and Cho Young

00:55:28.140 --> 00:55:30.350
Cho Young? This is my name

00:55:30.940 --> 00:55:32.940
Oh, that's it. Now I see

00:55:33.020 --> 00:55:34.570
Cho Chun and Cho Young

00:55:35.980 --> 00:55:37.320
Wonderful speech

00:55:37.400 --> 00:55:39.780
Servant Li, come with me

00:55:40.320 --> 00:55:41.910
Take the food to the master

00:55:41.990 --> 00:55:43.120
Yes, of course

00:55:44.620 --> 00:55:46.700
Maid Kim conducts a wake

00:55:47.540 --> 00:55:49.620
for me and my father?

00:56:28.160 --> 00:56:30.540
They brought us rice with mushrooms. My favorite

00:56:30.620 --> 00:56:33.880
Maid Kim is a great cook

00:56:41.090 --> 00:56:42.510
It's biting! I caught it!

00:56:53.020 --> 00:56:55.480
I hooked a worm. She fell for him

00:56:56.650 --> 00:56:58.230
We can eat it

00:57:03.780 --> 00:57:05.160
Here we go...

00:57:23.010 --> 00:57:24.010
Hold

00:57:29.930 --> 00:57:31.640
Take your time

00:57:33.230 --> 00:57:35.810
One day you will feel this feeling

00:57:35.900 --> 00:57:38.270
when the goldfish bites

00:57:38.360 --> 00:57:41.940
This will be Chisu - the ability to control energy

00:57:43.650 --> 00:57:44.660
Clear

00:57:45.740 --> 00:57:48.700
Master Li, you taught me to read "Words of the Heart"

00:57:49.410 --> 00:57:51.700
Why do you keep helping me?

00:57:52.960 --> 00:57:55.830
By chance for no reason

00:57:56.330 --> 00:57:59.380
which should be kept secret?

00:58:01.300 --> 00:58:02.760
It's none of your business

00:58:02.840 --> 00:58:04.510
Did you think I wouldn't find out?

00:58:07.050 --> 00:58:08.510
This concerns my family

00:58:13.520 --> 00:58:15.100
It's because of the maid Kim, right?

00:58:17.020 --> 00:58:20.320
You constantly shower her with compliments.

00:58:20.400 --> 00:58:22.730
And you also have a scarf around your neck...

00:58:22.820 --> 00:58:25.110
He's from the shop she goes to.

00:58:26.150 --> 00:58:27.360
This is her gift, right?

00:58:28.410 --> 00:58:29.620
And most importantly,

00:58:29.700 --> 00:58:33.410
I saw dried wildflowers in Kim's maid's room

00:58:33.500 --> 00:58:35.750
Danhyangok is full of them

00:58:35.830 --> 00:58:37.370
And this is your gift, right?

00:58:38.960 --> 00:58:41.590
- Yes, it's true
- So I knew it

00:58:42.920 --> 00:58:44.970
But you practice chastity...

00:58:45.050 --> 00:58:48.300
I don’t have “those” feelings for her!

00:58:48.890 --> 00:58:51.510
I think she's beautiful and kind-hearted

00:58:51.600 --> 00:58:53.020
That's all

00:58:53.560 --> 00:58:56.600
It's the same as confessing your feelings for her

00:58:56.690 --> 00:58:58.730
Relationships between men and women are always “like this”

00:58:59.310 --> 00:59:00.190
And what about yourself?

00:59:00.860 --> 00:59:03.900
You are a man and Moo Deok is a woman. What's between you?

00:59:05.900 --> 00:59:07.490
As for me...

00:59:09.110 --> 00:59:10.280
I like her

00:59:15.750 --> 00:59:18.710
I can't believe I'm saying this to someone who practices chastity.

00:59:18.790 --> 00:59:22.250
Only the maid Kim already likes someone

00:59:22.340 --> 00:59:23.710
I hope I didn't hurt your feelings

00:59:23.800 --> 00:59:25.380
I also have to say

00:59:26.210 --> 00:59:28.840
I heard Moo Deok likes Yul

00:59:28.930 --> 00:59:31.510
Dan Gu told you this? What kind of conversation is this worldly?

00:59:31.600 --> 00:59:33.510
I'm not just messing around with you here

00:59:35.640 --> 00:59:37.310
I realized that worldly talk...

00:59:38.140 --> 00:59:40.020
sometimes they are useful

00:59:42.150 --> 00:59:44.230
Thanks to the story of Julia's first love,

00:59:44.320 --> 00:59:47.240
I was able to find out about Nak Soo, the killer

00:59:50.240 --> 00:59:53.240
The girl he met in Danhyangok

00:59:54.330 --> 00:59:55.700
turned out to be Nak Soo

00:59:56.830 --> 00:59:58.290
He realized that it was her...

00:59:58.370 --> 01:00:01.080
because of the whistle given to them. He lay next to her body

01:00:03.290 --> 01:00:07.340
I know you overheard my conversation with Jin in Saejukwon

01:00:10.090 --> 01:00:12.720
Therefore, you yourself know about the history of Nak Su

01:00:16.520 --> 01:00:18.390
Come home early today

01:00:19.350 --> 01:00:20.940
Maid Kim conducts a wake...

01:00:21.730 --> 01:00:25.110
for a little girl who died a terrible death

01:00:41.580 --> 01:00:42.960
That's all

01:00:43.540 --> 01:00:44.880
Constellation bowl set

01:00:44.960 --> 01:00:47.920
Take your servants back to Sosnovy Bor

01:00:48.000 --> 01:00:51.130
No, not perfect yet

01:00:51.220 --> 01:00:52.680
We like everything

01:00:52.760 --> 01:00:54.010
What do you think?

01:00:54.090 --> 01:00:55.470
Just take a look

01:00:55.550 --> 01:00:59.350
Bowl and stem colors are different

01:00:59.930 --> 01:01:01.980
Need to change the leg

01:01:02.060 --> 01:01:04.100
We've changed it many times already.

01:01:04.600 --> 01:01:05.940
We like everything

01:01:06.020 --> 01:01:07.440
The head of Sosnovy Bor promised

01:01:07.520 --> 01:01:10.400
that everything will return as it was

01:01:10.990 --> 01:01:12.780
You can't make mistakes

01:01:14.280 --> 01:01:16.870
Usually it takes no more than two days

01:01:17.580 --> 01:01:19.200
But this time everything was somehow delayed

01:01:19.290 --> 01:01:21.660
Don't you like us coming here?

01:01:21.750 --> 01:01:23.670
Why would that be?

01:01:23.750 --> 01:01:28.380
I just think Sosnovy Bor is wasting time and money.

01:01:32.220 --> 01:01:35.430
Don't worry about Sosnovy Bor's money

01:01:37.680 --> 01:01:40.390
Yul, last time we met, I noted your skills

01:01:40.470 --> 01:01:42.140
Already mastered Chisu?

01:01:43.980 --> 01:01:45.060
Yes

01:01:46.150 --> 01:01:48.400
It turns out that you are the first magician of Jeonjingak,

01:01:48.480 --> 01:01:50.650
possessed Chisu

01:01:51.280 --> 01:01:54.320
Just like my father. Seo Il must be very proud of you

01:01:55.320 --> 01:01:57.070
Is he the magician of Jeongjingak?

01:01:58.740 --> 01:02:00.790
You can't drag a person against his will

01:02:06.250 --> 01:02:07.920
Can you stand up?

01:02:10.170 --> 01:02:11.300
What are you looking at?

01:02:14.550 --> 01:02:16.640
Is he the magician of Jeongjingak?

01:02:16.720 --> 01:02:19.180
- His name is Seo Yul?
- Yes

01:02:19.260 --> 01:02:21.930
They are the sons of noble families, not your cup of tea

01:02:22.520 --> 01:02:24.430
Stop wandering around here, sit quietly

01:02:30.900 --> 01:02:33.780
Maybe the thief So Yi is no match for him

01:02:37.030 --> 01:02:39.950
But once I become Jin Bu Young, the future head of Jinyoung,

01:02:41.620 --> 01:02:43.160
everything can change

01:02:51.920 --> 01:02:54.630
This is for Master Chan's friend and his daughter

01:02:56.970 --> 01:02:58.720
Their bodies were not buried

01:02:59.720 --> 01:03:02.220
and hardly anyone remembers them

01:03:02.970 --> 01:03:04.810
Therefore, I will hold at least one service

01:03:06.730 --> 01:03:07.850
Maid Kim

01:03:10.730 --> 01:03:11.980
Thank you

01:03:13.020 --> 01:03:14.320
What?

01:03:16.440 --> 01:03:17.900
They would be very grateful to you

01:03:18.990 --> 01:03:21.410
I'm sure they are very grateful

01:03:23.120 --> 01:03:24.790
Glad to hear that

01:03:26.410 --> 01:03:28.750
Do not extinguish incense sticks until they burn out

01:03:56.690 --> 01:03:58.900
Cho Chun, Cho Young

01:04:15.500 --> 01:04:19.470
Cho Chun, Cho Young

01:04:27.600 --> 01:04:28.810
Father...

01:04:41.150 --> 01:04:43.280
Mister Chan went fishing

01:04:43.370 --> 01:04:46.080
He'll be back soon, you can wait inside

01:04:47.580 --> 01:04:49.410
Did Moo Deok go with him?

01:04:49.500 --> 01:04:51.710
No, she's at home

01:04:51.790 --> 01:04:53.330
Helped with the wake

01:05:07.810 --> 01:05:10.230
Cho Chun, Cho Young

01:05:12.810 --> 01:05:14.150
If I hadn't left you...

01:05:15.480 --> 01:05:17.070
one in the mountains

01:05:20.900 --> 01:05:25.030
you wouldn't have to hold back your tears right now

01:05:25.870 --> 01:05:28.240
and pretend to be someone else

01:05:33.580 --> 01:05:35.170
But even now

01:05:37.170 --> 01:05:39.630
I can't come...

01:05:40.590 --> 01:05:42.630
and tell you that I know who you are

01:05:55.690 --> 01:05:57.310
Cho Chun, Cho Young

01:06:03.400 --> 01:06:04.650
Are the sticks burnt out?

01:06:06.280 --> 01:06:07.320
Yes

01:06:07.990 --> 01:06:09.030
Burned out

01:06:09.620 --> 01:06:10.540
Have you been sitting here?

01:06:14.040 --> 01:06:15.370
Let's clean everything up

01:06:55.290 --> 01:06:58.210
When did you return? I heard you went fishing

01:06:58.290 --> 01:07:00.340
Yes, just got back

01:07:00.420 --> 01:07:01.750
Are you alone? Where is Dan Gu?

01:07:01.840 --> 01:07:04.590
He has some business to attend to. I think he's dating someone

01:07:04.670 --> 01:07:05.920
How's that?

01:07:07.180 --> 01:07:08.430
Why did you come?

01:07:08.510 --> 01:07:11.510
The head said you can come back

01:07:12.100 --> 01:07:14.520
Faster than I thought

01:07:15.480 --> 01:07:18.690
Sit down, let's have a drink. I still needed to talk to you

01:07:18.770 --> 01:07:20.400
I can't, I'm sorry

01:07:21.150 --> 01:07:23.690
- I need to return to Sosnovy Bor
- Yes?

01:07:23.780 --> 01:07:26.900
Then we'll talk later, in Jeonjingak

01:07:27.450 --> 01:07:29.160
You will be very surprised

01:07:30.820 --> 01:07:34.410
Uk, I'll be back to Soho Fortress soon

01:07:36.160 --> 01:07:38.040
I promised my father that I would stay in Jeongjingak

01:07:38.120 --> 01:07:40.710
until I master Chisu

01:07:41.420 --> 01:07:43.880
Master Ho wrote a letter to his father,

01:07:43.960 --> 01:07:45.840
so soon he will tell me to come back

01:07:46.420 --> 01:07:47.510
Then I'll have to leave

01:07:47.590 --> 01:07:49.180
But Soho fortress is very far away

01:07:50.050 --> 01:07:52.970
Dan Gu and I will miss you so much

01:07:54.640 --> 01:07:56.310
I want to take with me

01:07:58.020 --> 01:07:59.850
someone

01:08:02.560 --> 01:08:04.520
- Who?
- I can’t say yet

01:08:06.650 --> 01:08:07.900
I'll tell you when the time comes

01:08:10.150 --> 01:08:11.860
I'll go. See you tomorrow

01:08:12.990 --> 01:08:14.080
Okay. Bye

01:08:48.360 --> 01:08:49.780
Because I was bored

01:08:49.860 --> 01:08:51.950
I really liked this man

01:08:55.740 --> 01:08:58.750
Nomads can only recover by sucking out someone else’s energy.

01:08:58.830 --> 01:09:00.120
Having done this once,

01:09:01.210 --> 01:09:02.790
they turn into monsters

01:09:04.000 --> 01:09:05.920
And our task is

01:09:06.880 --> 01:09:08.210
protect the world from them

01:09:11.260 --> 01:09:14.430
Does Yul really know everything?

01:09:15.720 --> 01:09:17.560
I want to take with me

01:09:18.140 --> 01:09:20.020
someone

01:09:26.560 --> 01:09:27.900
Owner

01:09:27.980 --> 01:09:29.110
What?

01:09:32.150 --> 01:09:35.030
Has Seo Yul already left? Maid Kim gave it to him

01:09:42.330 --> 01:09:43.830
Looks like he was talking about you

01:09:44.710 --> 01:09:47.670
Who? Did Seo Yul say something?

01:09:51.210 --> 01:09:52.840
I can go back

01:09:53.720 --> 01:09:55.050
Is that why you're so upset?

01:09:55.840 --> 01:09:57.930
When you return to the forest,

01:09:58.470 --> 01:10:00.930
your duel with Cha Bum will take place

01:10:01.020 --> 01:10:02.140
Are you afraid to lose?

01:10:03.020 --> 01:10:04.520
I won't lose tomorrow

01:10:07.270 --> 01:10:08.480
I finally got it done

01:10:27.830 --> 01:10:30.000
Today is Chan Wook's last fight

01:10:33.170 --> 01:10:35.430
We have slightly changed the betting conditions

01:10:35.510 --> 01:10:37.260
Winner of today's match

01:10:38.090 --> 01:10:40.390
will receive not a golden toad, but something else

01:10:54.820 --> 01:10:56.360
Winner

01:10:57.780 --> 01:10:59.070
win the maid

01:11:05.410 --> 01:11:07.080
I agreed to serve him

01:11:09.000 --> 01:11:11.210
who will win today

01:11:20.850 --> 01:11:23.010
- What's going on?
- Excellent

01:11:23.680 --> 01:11:25.310
Chan Wook's last opponent

01:11:26.060 --> 01:11:27.020
come forward

01:11:55.460 --> 01:11:56.380
Chan Wook

01:11:58.300 --> 01:12:00.090
Today to fight with you

01:12:01.300 --> 01:12:02.600
I'll be there

01:12:31.560 --> 01:12:51.840
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:12:51.840 --> 01:12:54.800
Alchemy

01:12:51.840 --> 01:12:54.800
Shower

01:12:57.020 --> 01:13:01.990
Uk can bring chaos to this world

01:13:02.070 --> 01:13:04.280
What happens if he attracts attention?

01:13:04.370 --> 01:13:06.200
We need to choose the one who will definitely win

01:13:06.280 --> 01:13:08.790
I'll win and take her with me as a maid

01:13:08.870 --> 01:13:12.750
Has he mastered the techniques of the previous nine opponents?

01:13:12.830 --> 01:13:13.790
I have to find him

01:13:13.880 --> 01:13:15.000
Then you have to lose something

01:13:15.080 --> 01:13:17.090
Your quivering love did not give in to anyone

01:13:17.170 --> 01:13:20.010
Only then will I be able to look into his eyes without shame

01:13:20.090 --> 01:13:23.840
Ask around about Moo Deok. What kind of girl is she

01:13:23.930 --> 01:13:26.100
“A look filled with tenderness”, same for me

01:13:26.180 --> 01:13:27.350
You don't consider me a woman

01:13:27.430 --> 01:13:29.930
- Don’t regret it later
- Okay, go ahead!

01:13:31.140 --> 01:13:34.810
I really like you, master
